<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107490" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερέρχομαι</span></b> , aor. 2
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ῆλθον,</span>
		pf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ελήλυθα</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pass over, cross,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς πηγὰς τοῦ ποταμοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					4.4.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὄρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					16.21
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν θάλατταν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					3.1.5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>surpass, excel,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρεταῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					13.15
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>overcome</i> or <i>survive</i> a disease, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἢν ταύτην ὑπερέλθῃ ὁ νοσέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>SA</u>
					1.10
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
